{
  "about": "Map property and PvP (issue #108): on pvp_y_1-2 the counter shows rank and players, a death drops the rank, /pvpinfo prints the record, @pvpoff and @pvpon switch it; guild_vs1 is a GvG map (property 3) and @gvgoff/@gvgon switch it. Leaves both maps' flags as it found them; a run stopped halfway leaves them changed until the map server restarts. The attack rules are #140's.",
  "account": "",
  "slot": 0,
  "second": {
    "account": "2",
    "slot": 0
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "say": "@warp pvp_y_1-2"
    },
    {
      "settle": 1500
    },
    {
      "wait": 300
    },
    {
      "expect": {
        "state": {
          "map_property": {
            "type": 1,
            "flags": 1841
          },
          "pvp_rank": [
            1,
            1
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "shot": "pvp-counter",
      "crop": [
        824,
        140,
        200,
        80
      ]
    },
    {
      "say": "@recall {second}"
    },
    {
      "as": "second",
      "settle": 2000
    },
    {
      "wait": 1500
    },
    {
      "expect": {
        "state": {
          "pvp_rank": [
            1,
            2
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "as": "second",
      "expect": {
        "state": {
          "pvp_rank": [
            1,
            2
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "as": "second",
      "say": "@die"
    },
    {
      "wait": 1500
    },
    {
      "as": "second",
      "expect": {
        "state": {
          "pvp_rank": [
            2,
            2
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
